        <activityName xml:lang="en">xxx Logs, mixed, at forest</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Logs, mixed, at forest
The volume refers to the wood including the bark. The logs have a water content (u) of 20%, a mass of 607 kg/m3 and a lower heating value of 15.5 MJ/kg.;
Synonyms: Brennholz; 
UUID: 410aed90-695f-3f43-9c9f-55e71beca7d5
Includes only the splitting of the average mix of 72% residual softwood and 28% residual hardwood (reflecting Swiss average wood consumption)  with a diesel powered splitting machine
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Motormanual production with diesel powerded splitting machine
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: see Geography
Uncertainty adjustments: The assumption that Switzerland is representative for central Europe is considered in the uncertainties.
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_410aed90-695f-3f43-9c9f-55e71beca7d5.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
